      <title>Version 1.19.4</title>
      <description><![CDATA[
<h3>Improved</h3>
<ul>
<li>Support for high resolution monitors with updated video codec</li>
<li>Window enumerator to support recording hidden game windows</li>
<li>Support for customisable menu bar keyboard shortcuts</li>
</ul>

<h3>Fixed</h3>
<ul>
<li>Bug when deleting the last remaining clip for a recorded video</li>
<li>Cursor position tracking in region-based recording mode</li>
</ul>
      ]]></description>
